        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "The safety and effectiveness of QUVIVIQ have not been established in pediatric patients.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-quviviq",
          "section": "8.4"
        }
      ]
